{"action_id":null,"arguments":[],"assumptions":[{"assumption_id":"node.d9f34661763298a954a3958c.a0","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The assessment concerns one offered benefit in a distributor’s promotion of SFC-authorised funds.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.d9f34661763298a954a3958c.a1","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"A genuine discount can be treated as excepted even where it otherwise falls within the assessed gift category.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.d9f34661763298a954a3958c.a2","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The surrounding product-promotion language implicitly confines the discount exception to fees or charges relating to that product; this qualification is not express.","status":"PROVISIONAL"}],"bundle_hash":"6c94c79ab5d669c65fe90304f4e7c7cc746f943d610e44065a3cee28f5525628","candidate_id":"candidate.ab0fb1ecc4d04555af0025959c5ee557","controlled_language":"Selected control: paragraph-10 gift-promotion restriction, with a product-related fee-discount exception. Within scope, an offered gift is caught unless it is a genuine discount of fees or charges relating to the promoted product or product type. A true result identifies an offer caught by this selected restriction only.","disposition_reason":"Unreviewed interpretation proposal","family_ids":["exceptions"],"generation_phase":"BLIND_INITIAL","issue_ids":["issue.de09c3ee40dd43cab4c73d9774ccfbf4","issue.6d4f7dd2a1074f5dbe0d536f59145908","issue.91cabeac36a14b038eb5a2f1ae7b8f68"],"parent_id":null,"probability_of_legal_correctness":null,"revision_reason":"On this contextual reading, a discount on unrelated service fees remains caught if it qualifies as a gift linked to fund promotion. The anti-distraction purpose supports the narrower exception, but the absence of an express product-related qualifier is its strongest weakness.","run_id":"run.d6106e5450c749a58852e36e6f81a6e0","scheduling_priority":0,"schema_version":"interpretation.v1","score_purpose":"INVESTIGATION_PRIORITY_ONLY","source_packet_hash":"7b78bffd5267abb04c58ab204d1e34f621dc3fb03008be1b35980abcaa535ba4","source_unit_ids":["u14","u30"],"status":"ACTIVE","subject_unit":"Breadth of the fee-discount exception"}